WEBVTT

00:01:28.831 --> 00:01:31.827
This poem might seem odd,

00:01:31.827 --> 00:01:35.356
written by a 13-year-old girl,

00:01:35.356 --> 00:01:40.139
but where I and Eileen come from,

00:01:40.139 --> 00:01:43.900
this poem, which I have just read to you,

00:01:43.900 --> 00:01:47.616
is a warrior's cry.

00:01:47.616 --> 00:01:50.541
I am from Malawi.

00:01:51.191 --> 00:01:55.115
Malawi is one of the poorest countries,

00:01:55.115 --> 00:01:57.994
very poor,

00:01:57.994 --> 00:02:02.522
where gender equality is questionable.